sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend React
    participant API as FastAPI (demeter-api)
    participant Redis as Redis (demeter-redis)
    participant Disp as WS Dispatcher (tarea asyncio)
    participant RPi as Raspberry Pi Gateway

    Note over FE, RPi: Flujo de un Comando de Usuario: encender pin 4, nodo 3

    FE->>API: POST /api/command\n{"type":"set_gpio","target_id":3,"pin":4,"value":1}
    
    activate API
    API->>API: Validacion Pydantic (TypeAdapter discriminado)
    API->>Redis: PUBLISH demeter:commands\n(payload JSON serializado)
    API->>Redis: SETEX demeter:cache:device:4 OFF 60s
    API->>Redis: LPUSH demeter:activity:batch {evento}
    API-->>FE: HTTP 202 Accepted\n{"status": "queued"}
    deactivate API
    
    Note over Redis, RPi: El listener ya estaba corriendo en background
    
    Redis-->>Disp: Mensaje en canal demeter:commands
    activate Disp
    Disp->>Disp: Parsear JSON, TypeAdapter.validate_python()
    Disp->>RPi: registry.send("raspberry_gateway", cmd)
    deactivate Disp
    
    Note over RPi: La RPi serializa a trama binaria y envía por UART
    
    RPi-->>API: Evento telemetria o CMD_ACK por /ws/raspberry_gateway
    API->>Redis: SETEX sensor:3:telemetry {datos} 60s
    API-->>FE: Push WS broadcast a clientes frontend
